---

<section class="section tour" id="tour">
  <div class="shell tgrid">
    <div class="copy reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Watch the tour · 89 seconds</span>
      <h2 class="h-section">A field study of the <em>Hyprland ricer</em>, and the file manager that finally matches.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Previews for code, Markdown, PDFs, archives and fonts. Space to inspect anything, EXIF included. Split panes, bulk rename, undo, ten live themes, all from the keyboard. Every frame is the real app.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="frame vid reveal">
      <video controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/media/tour.jpg">
        <source src="/media/tour.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      </video>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tour { padding-top: 0; }
  .tgrid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.35fr); gap: 40px; align-items: center; padding-top: clamp(48px, 7vw, 88px); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .copy { display: grid; gap: 18px; }
  .copy .h-section { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); }
  .vid { aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; }
  .vid video { background: var(--crust); }
  @media (max-width: 960px) { .tgrid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
</style>
